# The account server image (`deploy/server/Dockerfile`) is built from the repository root,
# and without this file the whole tree goes to the daemon: `.env` with keys, builds of
# hundreds of megabytes, session recordings, chats, models. A single `COPY . .` added in
# the future would be enough to put the secrets into an image layer. So everything is
# excluded except the three paths that the Dockerfile takes by itself.
*
!deploy/server/requirements.txt
!src/argus/__init__.py
!src/argus/server
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
